<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales rise 11.5 pct in June.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales rise 11.5 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Thursday its sales for June were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	    1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +11.5		   43,629	  39,126</p>
<p>   Cars	     +9.5		   25,960	  23,718</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +14.7		   17,669	  15,408</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +12.9		  227,166	  201,182</p>
<p>   Cars	    +12.1		  131,610	  117,420</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +14.1		   95,556	   83,762</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
